+- The implementation hand receives one node only: `NODE_001` in `.cart0/300.100.WORK_GRAPH.md`.
+- The only authorized writes are `src/windowing.py` and `src/summary.py`, as specified by `.cart0/000.100.AUTHORITY.md` and `.cart0/300.200.CRATE_001.md`.
